# Prelude for the tensor-manipulation catalogue.
#
# Extends the default prelude with the heads the catalogue needs and the
# default one lacks: a generic antisymmetric rank-2 (F, the Maxwell
# field), a generic symmetric rank-2 (S), a generic rank-2 with no
# symmetry at all (T, for the negative controls), and a vector (V) and
# covector-style vector (xi, the Killing field).

manifold M dim 4
bundle TM on M dim 4

head R : TM*, TM*, TM*, TM* symmetry (1 2)- (3 4)- (1 3)(2 4)+
head g : TM*, TM* symmetry (1 2)+
head eps : TM*, TM*, TM* symmetry antisymmetric

head F : TM*, TM* symmetry (1 2)-
head S : TM*, TM* symmetry (1 2)+
head T : TM*, TM*
head V : TM*
head xi : TM*
head J : TM*
